1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:02,360
Ask an AI about a Malaysian rule,

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:04,152
and it answers with confidence.

3
00:00:04,152 --> 00:00:06,920
Sometimes the rule changed years ago.

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,746
We asked 3 models 23 questions.

5
00:00:09,746 --> 00:00:12,900
28 of 68 answers stated a rule that is

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,460
no longer current.

7
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:19,360
Terkini checks those answers against official government pages.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,051
Each claim goes to Tavily Search,

9
00:00:22,051 --> 00:00:23,872
restricted to official domains,

10
00:00:23,872 --> 00:00:26,464
with live results for rules that change.

11
00:00:26,464 --> 00:00:29,800
Then Tavily Extract reads the page itself.

12
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:32,400
Here the answer says 6%.

13
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,648
The customs page says 8%,

14
00:00:34,648 --> 00:00:36,320
from March 2024.

15
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,520
Outdated.

16
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:42,300
Every verdict must quote the page word for word.

17
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,853
Terkini then checks that the quote is really there.

18
00:00:44,853 --> 00:00:45,840
No exact quote,

19
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,160
no verdict.

20
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,680
The models run through Bifrost:

21
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,760
one virtual key,

22
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:51,640
a daily budget,

23
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,960
and fallbacks across vendors.

24
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,400
Terkini flagged 17 answers,

25
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,104
and 10 were really stale.

26
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:01,560
That is 59% precision and 36% recall.

27
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,520
The misses are published too.
